      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: I thought it wise to start a new journal while I document my research.
          Whoever finds this in the future I hope my work aids you in any degree,
          for I now know what it is like to be at the mercy of the unknown.\n\n 
          My initial work was centred around biological enhancement. A somewhat gray
          area within the Veils teachings. I chose to balance on a thin line where
          the practicing of the Old Gods almost dared blur into the now.
    - rid: 8910043712502366377
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
