    - rid: 8910043712502366385
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "Their <b>\u201Cenhancements\u201D</b> were heretical, undignified
          mutilations of the human body; those who worshiped them were far too gone
          to realise. We are not built upon pagan fantasies.\\n\\n   We are different.\\n\\n 
          I would be a hypocrite however to not admit the fear that pulsed through
          my body when I saw it occur the first time.\\n\\n  A man collapsed before
          the Beacon, the flesh of his arms ripped like a chasm as clusters of hands
          wriggled out, fingers twitching and pulsing like maggots."
    - rid: 8910043712502366386
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
