    - rid: 8910043712502366395
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: He wailed in agony as the hands continued to crawl out from beneath
          his skin, we could hear the scratching and tearing as each of them surfaced,
          pushing through their torn opening like a fetus. He was alive by the end,
          alive through it all.\n\n  We prided ourselves in knowledge, the unknown
          was beneath us, and yet we had no answers. On the ground where our greatest
          achievement was built, an even greater mystery awakened, and I will not
          rest until I have answers.\n\n
    - rid: 8910043712502366396
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
