    - rid: 8910043712502366417
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: Report Analysis
    - rid: 8910043712502366418
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: As predicted, heart failure was the cause of death. His body did
          not have enough blood to maintain dozens of newly birthed hands. There
          seems to be no current method of entirely halting this rapid growth.\n\n 
          Symptoms slow down significantly after the initial frenzy, but it is the
          aftermath that kills. We are delicate creations, our composition made to
          be efficient, the body can only handle so many foreign anomalies.
    - rid: 8910043712502366419
