    - rid: 8910043712502366437
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 'A week since the initial frenzy. Cremation seems to be the most
          viable option, we allow ourselves an hour of study before burning them,
          it has been our only current fail safe to prevent further spread of disease.\n\n   
          We have been documenting the difference in the manner this sickness presents
          itself. There has been no limit to what organs or limbs can flare and spread,
          internal or external. Our current hypothesis is that this is an airborne
          pathogen due to how quickly it is able to spread in such a short span of
          time.\n\n '
    - rid: 8910043712502366438
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
