    - rid: 8910043712502366453
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "There is one thing that drives me to doubt this theory though.
          We had a sample of five people, one of which contracted this infection,
          we had immediately quarantined the rest, keeping them under watch as we
          expected that they would show signs of this sickness soon enough.\\n\\n  
          Yet none of them contracted it\u2026\\n\\n   A week later we quarantined
          a group of six expecting that they would follow a similar pattern, four
          of them contracted it while the other two showed no signs.\\n\\n"
    - rid: 8910043712502366454
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
    - rid: 8910043712502366455
      type: {class: WireModel, ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
