    - rid: 8910043712502366644
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.Int32, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 23
    - rid: 8910043712502366645
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 'Sodium levels were abnormally elevated, they were being actively
          dehydrated at a rapid rate. It was Salt. The tissue was retaining far too
          much water, their hands and feet were bloated but we assumed it was a byproduct
          of the sickness.\n\n  Administering fluids seems to slow the spread down,
          but it does not stop it. The rate is slow enough that they can survive
          after, but even after surgically removing new growth it returns after some
          time.\n\n  We are presenting these findings to the Maker soon, the Veil
          will shield us, it will guide our minds to find the root of this, for we
          are its most faithful.\n\n '
